				   account for --header-height — a .hero padding rule here would win the whole shorthand
				   by source order and silently erase that offset (confirmed happening before this fix:
				   hero-content rendered 16px underneath the fixed header on mobile). */
				.hero p {
					margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
